# boost_probe2.sh — second failing pass, 2026-09-22 ~22:08 (BEFORE the AC power cycle)
# This variant writes "256" to pp_dpm_sclk, which is INVALID (level indices max
# 31) -> EINVAL, so the force step did nothing. Kept as-run for fidelity.
